('2a2b468e-e657-41a6-9326-545abaef8225', '8918d413-ebfe-44bc-8d57-e874912cfe23', 'Create an SCP that applies to all the AWS accounts to deny IAM actions for all users except for those with administrator roles. Apply the SCP to the root OU.', 1, 'C', '2025-11-09 15:58:53', '2025-11-09 15:58:53'),
