('2a471b84-e77d-41d9-8948-ab94e49b2122', 'f50affe6-dc2b-4ae3-a622-8aba184e5941', 'Disable ECR basic scanning.Pull images older than 12 months and push those images back to the ECR repository.Enable ECR enhanced scanning', 0, 'C', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
