('380962c2-9034-4067-8495-f537286b5c95', '9f590449-9758-4b4d-b807-bc8ca2f8fa4a', 'Enable Amazon GuardDuty.Create an assessment report and deliver the report to an Amazon S3 bucket.Create an AWS Lambda function that runs when a new report is delivered to the S3 bucket.Configure the Lambda function to process the report and send a notification to the compliance team by using Amazon SNS.', 0, 'C', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
('380eee34-0597-41da-b92b-0b4599e166cc', 'ff5be952-6519-45e3-9cae-0f0d071704f7', 'フラグメントは、再利用可能な軽量のUI部品です。', 1, 'A', '2025-11-10 05:18:19', '2025-11-10 05:18:19'),
('381060ff-cc55-4ace-97ec-a1ecec6f37a8', '930f3196-bd27-48b3-a4b9-5b65598122a5', 'In 主区域，在数据库上创建运行状况检查，该检查将在检测到故障时调用 AWS Lambda 函数。对辅助区域执行数据库迁移，以从辅助区域中的最新数据库快照重新创建数据库，并更新新的 Route 53 主机记录。', 0, 'B', '2025-11-10 17:25:19', '2025-11-10 17:25:19'),
