('39aaf30d-6d9c-408e-9165-76377414ef46', 'e555dc1c-97c4-480d-bb2f-36f3e3cf2170', 'Migrate the application to Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) containers that use the Fargate launch type in three Availability Zones. Use Amazon S3 to provide file storage for all three containers. Use a Network Load Balancer to direct traffic to the containers.', 0, 'A', '2025-11-09 15:58:53', '2025-11-09 15:58:53'),
