('4a67ae15-fe15-4aca-ac76-eb38acedb64d', '14444d56-f929-4f9f-91fb-5bf3639654d5', 'Use Amazon EventBridge to schedule an AWS Lambda function to copy the EBS snapshots to the additional Regions', 0, 'B', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
