('912102a1-ec82-427f-8952-29c67f041d01', '499e910d-beb2-403c-86b5-dd46f42805fd', 'Create an AWS Global Accelerator accelerator with multiple endpoint groups that target endpoints in appropriate AWS Regions.Use the accelerator\'s static IP address to create a record in public DNS for the apex domain', 1, 'C', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
