('b7ba3013-f43b-461f-8694-91c9443cbf09', '3e0cf89d-2b85-490c-865b-970e2c66f822', 'Deploy an AWS Database Migration Service (AWS DMS) replication instance on AWS.Configure source endpoints for each Oracle workload.Configure a target endpoint for Amazon Redshift.When connectivity is established, create a migration task for each source database to generate a pre-migration assessment report', 0, 'A', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
