('b8b49278-b3a7-4672-b5d6-bd459138a0d3', 'bc2d9017-6ce7-4862-9168-ed45af79b88f', 'Suspend the Auto Scaling group\'s HealthCheck scaling process. Use Session Manager to log in to an instance that is marked as unhealthy.', 0, 'A', '2025-11-09 15:58:53', '2025-11-09 15:58:53'),
