('c41b9ddd-b404-43f0-bb65-5f257e6f3df0', '1120eb6c-9340-4ad5-a2bb-7a43208f32ac', 'Implement retry logic with exponential back off and irregular variation in the client application. Ensure that the errors are caught and handled with descriptive error messages.', 1, 'A', '2025-11-09 15:58:53', '2025-11-09 15:58:53'),
