('d3c94196-536e-4b29-b164-c2aaed703605', '0f2b661d-5641-4ed1-9686-ac42b334d03b', 'Run the aws s3 sync command as a user in the source account. Specify the source and destination buckets to copy the data.', 0, 'E', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
