('eae9d1b6-d086-4997-b0cc-4273f1554a2d', '38cf9da5-6421-47c4-942e-cd6725559572', '部署 AWS DataSync 代理并配置任务以将映像传输到 S3 存储桶。', 1, 'A', '2025-11-10 17:25:19', '2025-11-10 17:25:19'),
('eb057c54-258b-4ec7-b202-6e50480d849a', '7991e243-ed85-4e5e-bad7-97e33693c89d', 'Create an interface endpoint for Amazon S3 in each application\'s VPC. Configure the endpoint policy to allow access to an S3 access point. Create a VPC gateway attachment for the S3 endpoint.', 0, 'B', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
