('fb55e71e-6415-4e6c-9c5a-26aa805b0e18', 'bb9687ee-5e75-4b2b-ac26-9462f4551ee3', 'Create a new KMS multi-Region customer managed key.Create anew KMS customer managed replica key in each in-scope Region', 1, 'B', '2025-11-09 15:58:54', '2025-11-09 15:58:54'),
